the number of women murdered or missing  in northern Mexico has risen by almost  40 percent in the past five years the  situation has pushed one woman the city  of Monterey to launch an exclusively  female taxi service here's her story my  name is  Gonzalez founder of gross taxi Monterey  a family-owned Enterprise we offer  transport services for girls and women  and guarantee they get to their  destination safely  on our first weekend we started trending  and we were shared more than 42 000  times that made me very happy but at the  same time it got us thinking why such a  reaction it means that there's a vacuum  in our community that women are scared  foreign  [Applause]  that's what made us start this service  the fear of how unprotected we women of  any age are in our community  [Music]  we have more than 3 000 clients on  WhatsApp our other Social Network  accounts are also full we can't handle  any more requests  many girls tell us why they chose us  some were harassed mistreated even  sexually abused by a driver they are  terrified of using any service with male  drivers  we think that whatever a girl is doing  on the street she shouldn't feel  threatened or in danger  the business is called girls Taxi  it will always remind me of Dulce  Celeste my daughter  I founded it for her I went a female  driven Cab in every corner of the world  so she can feel safe
 

